OL,3,GNEWSARichmond Italian-themed festival
OL,4,Aplans refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to host a Sicilian-themed
OL,7,Ffestival on Richmond Green next summer
OL,8,Fhave been rejected over concerns about
OL,9,Fsafety, anti-social behaviour and
OL,10,Fnoise.
OL,12,FRichmond Council refused an application
OL,13,Ffor the Marzamemi Festival, which
OL,14,Forganisers wanted to bring to Richmond
OL,15,FGreen for the first time from 25 to 27
OL,16,FJune 2027.
OL,18,FThe event features Italian music, food,
OL,19,Fwine tasting, workshops, shopping and
OL,20,Fchildren's activities and was
OL,21,Fpreviously held in Old Deer Park in
OL,22,FRichmond, south-west London.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
